{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c48286191924f7a13ec1252bdc124fe79441ffe5d5df5c58175482e33ad5653", "ja": "（765プロ劇場の立ち上げに併せて、39人の\nアイドルを集めることとなった『39プロジェクト』）", "zh": "（在成立765艺能剧场的同时，\n透过『39PROJECT』召集了39位偶像。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dd1071a340bf504cc3bc1f9af78d4b8783192f71bd972d259c4e09276c330769", "ja": "（今、その説明を事務所のアイドルひとりひとりに\nしている真っ最中だ）", "zh": "（于现阶段当中，我正在对事务所的\n每位偶像进行相关说明。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "86d7a561ff385769bb47466d4bb3ea04a6abf9b76fe159d2bd9c3df2687ecaef", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nお待たせしてしまって、すみません。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n抱歉让你久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "dfadcf195190c5b73cc78154fa63dd3cdb02d3a99992aa4f8e183a7611818607", "ja": "いえ、こっちこそ呼び出しちゃって申し訳ないです。", "zh": "不，我才抱歉把你叫出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "fb479192c2cf61c4fa2816e122a42244d88d6ab487fc4f2413e57f571f4c8a34", "ja": "ふふっ、気にしないでください。\nそれで、お話というのは？", "zh": "呵呵，请不用在意。\n话说有什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c9b43f289cd1e883b7252f1471dc311834225c67aa2f168f5cd5465620e2aaa0", "ja": "実はですね……。", "zh": "其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_1006", "source_sha256": "c65ccc33afb4602aa7785d096218f40b9e336e8aada433950cb8632a421f5a8e", "ja": "説明をする", "zh": "进行说明", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2001_p", "source_sha256": "4fbbe368c29ca2e0e7e07f93c226bc683fffc2efb26a81281c47c01c60571e28", "ja": "と、いうわけなんです。", "zh": "就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2002_010azu", "source_sha256": "a472836efa325dc8ca86d51a2e98058a0103449967b6e1a77650ca14791c8302", "ja": "まぁ！　つまり、私にも後輩が？\nしかも一度に、39人も……。", "zh": "哎呀！意思是我也要有后辈了？\n而且还一口气多了39人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2003_010azu", "source_sha256": "02a8880f224fb426b0eccd4c1ad97340ab8bc60d98b0a4741e1083db7f9d76f3", "ja": "ふふっ、とってもにぎやかになりそうですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，感觉会变得很热闹呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "b2b99d053b8b39e1c06bee64d464a1b32ed66e0ecae65ea5c2313b47d374ac91", "ja": "はい。にぎやかというか、騒がしくなるかも\n知れませんけど、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "是啊。但与其说热闹，\n或许会是吵闹吧，没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2005_010azu", "source_sha256": "803ebf36a3c049d1f74fa573fb09da7d8bbe23121520a5eecf70dddad5441592", "ja": "もちろんです。後輩だなんて、学生の頃みたい……。\nふふっ、なんだかワクワクします～♪", "zh": "那当然。居然要有后辈了，就像学生时代一样……\n呵呵，总觉得好兴奋～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2006_010azu", "source_sha256": "103aa45dfac9a8c6397906ce63ef55c525ca308c6cd13728fa5432642bf29e7a", "ja": "あ、でも入ってくる子たちは……。きっと初めての\nことばかりで、不安になったりもしそうですよね？", "zh": "啊，不过进来的孩子们……\n一定有很多事都是第一次遇到，应该也会不安吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2007_010azu", "source_sha256": "91dba818d3abd2f13ff8ac7bce60229d0a4fedd42c04508c93474a961812962b", "ja": "私、できるだけ気をつけて、\nみんなが困らないようにお手伝いすることにします。", "zh": "我会尽量多注意，\n帮助大家解决困扰的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "c9460268bf282854dab821575eca83ea37229859ed549b641531fd8a3470a834", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　正直なところ、俺だけだと\nケアしきれない部分もありそうで……。", "zh": "谢谢你！说真的，光凭我一个人，\n感觉也没办法面面俱到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2009_010azu", "source_sha256": "c41040d29e21941819272ae44bfee88befbbf198a0d122c178ed5fe0cc3c1e75", "ja": "ふふっ、まして相手は女の子ですものね。私達が\nお話しした方が、いいこともあるかなって思います。", "zh": "呵呵，何况对象还是女孩子呢。\n我想有些事，可能更适合由我们去开口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2010_010azu", "source_sha256": "5e51fe551d302e746d586fe684cd34c7291a986230412b91356f2d7ad117cacc", "ja": "あ、それと……。{$P$}さんも、\n私達とお話してくださいね？", "zh": "啊，还有……{$P$}先生，\n你也要找机会和我们聊聊喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "351bffd59af6e9bc628ad22d2698e99d1033b83476968131c0547b3995b6cddf", "ja": "え、俺と……？　もちろん、いいですけど……\nどういうことですか？", "zh": "咦，我……？当然可以……\n但为什么要这样说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2012_010azu", "source_sha256": "0e08342296b3c72c52236e590dfd1a7f42db062cb584ba9ad1909651e8e6f182", "ja": "大きなプロジェクトが始まって、一番大変なのは、\n間違いなく{$P$}さんですから。", "zh": "因为大型专案开始后，最辛苦的人\n一定是{$P$}先生啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2013_010azu", "source_sha256": "3e28ac983c0d113163d573b2f7f62ec112cb5ed1f675fca60be2bb8bdcaffa65", "ja": "私達では力不足かもしれませんけれど、\n困った時は遠慮なく、声を掛けてください♪", "zh": "或许我们的力量有所不足，\n但是感到烦恼的时候，请尽管跟我说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2014_p", "source_sha256": "7f64bd44f91324edbf5bfeb142d8dc3ce2c67eafd04aaf128f656c66d91b35fe", "ja": "あずささん……。", "zh": "梓小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "f8f83fc55e474636ffd1a566662c6cd9d724e1ab97ca25aaacca227c6fe2210e", "ja": "ありがとうございます。大丈夫、みんなに心配かける\nようなことはしないって、約束します。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n没问题，我保证不会让大家担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2016_010azu", "source_sha256": "50e5943307213955cec2665dacd1ff8925718079434283e627c95de46d5de2dd", "ja": "はい、きっと先は長いですから、無理せずに……。\nみんなで一緒に、頑張っていきましょう♪", "zh": "好的，今后还有很长一条路要走，别太勉强自己……\n我们一起继续加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_010azu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_001_2017_p", "source_sha256": "38db48a97aaf732bdec48c411ba50d7f4cb11b96d80827033581d6d4cbbc019a", "ja": "（優しい気遣いが胸に沁みる……。\n自己管理もしっかりしながら、みんなで頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（她的体贴让我很感动……\n我可要做好自我管理，和大家一起加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
